      "title": "futatsuiwa_mamizou",
      "excerpt": "As Mamizou's official profile states that she dislikes foxes, she is considered an enemy of [[Yakumo Ran]]. However, she is good friends with [[Houjuu Nue]]. Her special skill is to disguise a thing's appearance, and she can also disguise her own. She uses a [[futatsuiwa_mamizou_(human)|human disguise]] in [[Forbidden Scrollery]]. In [[Unfinished Dream of All Living Ghost]], she accidentally got recruited into Gouyoku Alliance by [[Toutetsu Yuuma]].",
